      "source": "class Date {\n    int day, month, year;\n\n    Date(int d, int m, int y){\n        day = d;\n        month = m;\n        year = y;\n    }\n\n    Date(Date d){\n        day = d.day;\n        month = d.month;\n        year = d.year;\n    }\n\n    void display(){\n        System.out.println(day + \"/\" + month + \"/\" + year);\n    }\n}\n\nDate d1 = new Date(12,4,1954);\nDate d2 = new Date(d1);\n\nd1.display();\nd2.display();",
